  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Allowing the usage of ParentConstaint in quest avatars would be beneficial on avatars with props like swords, because it allows to move the existing prop instead of creating a copy and switching between the two, which is the method I've seen the most around. Just moving the same prop would allow to use less polygons, which is probably the most taxing element for the hardware.",
